====== 4. AXI4 Target Interface Address Map ======

The project type is hw_only.
Compatibility of HLS accelerator with reference SoC features: No.
SoC features are only supported when all the accelerator interfaces are either axi_target or axi_initiator:
  - The interfaces of the following argument(s), global variable(s), and/or module control are not axi_target or axi_initiator:
    module control, input_l, input_r, res.

Note:
- Incompatibility with SmartHLS SoC features does not impact functionality.
- If you want to use SmartHLS SoC features, please change the project type in config.tcl to Icicle_SoC or MiV_SoC,
  and ensure all interfaces are either axi_target or axi_initiator.

+------------------------------------------------------------+
| Accelerator Function: bypass_hw (Address Space Range: 0x4) |
